<p>Sometimes, containing things doesn’t keep the world secure and protected. Sometimes, people just want to be left alone.</p>
<p>I hadn’t really written characters or dialogue before. This was an attempt to change that.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1267048&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1510106054" alt="Ihp" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1267048)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;">Ihp</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thebillith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3042342&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1510106054" alt="TheBillith" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3042342)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/thebillith" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3042342); return false;">TheBillith</a></span> for their help on IRC.</p>
